codex
The translated program is now fixed in `solution.mpy`. One semantic nuance is worth making explicit: the supplied K model treats `Bool` as distinct from `Int` for `isinstance`; the HumanEval-style implementation itself uses Python’s ordinary `isinstance`, as expected by the prompt’s numeric examples. The proof will cover arbitrary mathematical integers plus short-circuit rejection at each non-integer argument position.
